---
import Main from "../../layouts/Main.astro";
import PageHeader from "../../components/PageHeader.astro";
import FeatureCard from "../../components/FeatureCard.astro";
---

<Main title="Indigenous Data Sovereignty - Aurora Nyxus" description="On-prem AI where data stays in community custody. Physical control, OCAP-aligned governance, attribution protection. The box lives where you decide.">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Sovereign / Indigenous data"
    title="Data that stays in the community's hands"
    lede="For Indigenous communities and organisations protecting knowledge and data sovereignty. When secure means the box is under your physical control, we deploy on-prem systems where custody, not a distant contract, is the assurance."
    glow
    fig="Fig. — Indigenous data sovereignty"
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-10">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink">Custody is the assurance</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
          For data sovereignty, security has a physical definition: the hardware
          is in the community's control. A network connection does not remove
          that requirement. We deploy so the box lives where you decide, with
          the safeguards set at the physical layer.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink">Governance-aligned</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
          We design deployments to respect data-sovereignty principles and
          OCAP-aligned governance: ownership, control, access, and possession
          stay with the community, and attribution is protected. This is a
          partnership, built on the community's terms.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-10">
    <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <FeatureCard title="Physical custody" index="01" accent="green">The box lives with you. Not a distant data centre.</FeatureCard>
      <FeatureCard title="OCAP-aligned" index="02" accent="signal">Ownership, control, access, possession stay with the community.</FeatureCard>
      <FeatureCard title="Attribution protected" index="03" accent="violet">Knowledge stays attributed and cannot be quietly taken.</FeatureCard>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-20 pt-6">
    <a href="/contact" class="inline-block rounded-sm border border-aurora-green/50 bg-aurora-green/10 px-6 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-medium text-aurora-green transition-colors hover:bg-aurora-green/20">Start a conversation</a>
  </section>
</Main>
